     "note": "The revised #200-002's own print fits: its body in the Arm Body's bore above L2, which is the upper 6810's press bore (65.1 mm), probed at 45 deg, clear of the flange's ears, and the +X ear slot on a Stator Balancer's 3.9 x 9.9 shank, centred at r 35.516. The seat's fits are the seat kind's.",
